<title>INDIA: Yield at Indian 91-day t-bill steady at 7.02 pct.</title>
<headline>Yield at Indian 91-day t-bill steady at 7.02 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it maintained the cut-off at 98.28 rupees at a weakly auction of 91-day treasury bills on Friday.</p>
<p>Dealers said the yield was steady at 7.02 percent.</p>
